WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.850
Pablo knows that "we can" is podemos.

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.970
So "I can" should be easy.

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.390
But the real form is: puedo.

4
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:13.090
Same verb, normal ending, yet
the vowel inside has changed.

5
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.490
Then he meets "I do": hago.

6
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.950
Where did that letter g come from?

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.950
So how can you tell when a verb
is going to change, and where?

8
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.730
In this mission, you'll
shade the "boot" shape of the

9
00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:28.370
stem-changing verbs, and learn
the verbs that are odd only in

10
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.150
the "I" form.

11
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.970
Then you'll memorise the
five core irregulars whole,

12
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.750
including ser and ir.

13
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:40.190
Your mission: catch Spanish
verbs in the act of changing.
